WEBVTT

00:11:30.367 --> 00:11:34.278
to a mother as less than a mother,

00:11:35.365 --> 00:11:38.750
to a child as less than a child.

00:11:40.519 --> 00:11:42.119
In the spring of 2018,

00:11:42.143 --> 00:11:46.837
the Trump administration announced
a new policy at the US-Mexico border,

00:11:46.861 --> 00:11:49.297
a zero-tolerance policy,

00:11:49.321 --> 00:11:54.162
to forcibly separate all children
from their parents,

00:11:54.186 --> 00:11:57.439
who were arriving at the border
seeking asylum;

00:11:57.463 --> 00:12:01.496
children as young as 18 months,
separated from their parents